  "purpose": "Canonical two-layer LuHm compatibility architecture. Layer one is the OpenAI-side agent compatibility plane. Layer two is the GitHub repository compatibility plane used to broker remote APIs and vendor runtimes that the OpenAI-side plane cannot directly connect.",
